      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003E93. To fry Pompion.\u003C/b\u003E Cut it in thin slices when it is pared, and steep it in Sack a while, then dip it in Eggs, and fry it in Butter, and put some Sack and Butter for Sauce, so serve it in with salt about the Dish brims.\u003Cbr\u003E"
